  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade Delegation to India Energy Week 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity supports Netherlands - India cooperation on green hydrogen through a Dutch trade delegation to India Energy Week. The delegation, consisting of Dutch companies, research institutions and policymakers, will engage in government to government and business to business meetings, thematic sessions and networking activities to promote Dutch hydrogen expertise and explore opportunities for collaboration in India&#x2019;s energy transition.Building on previous bilateral exchanges and missions, the initiative strengthens partnerships, increases the visibility of the Dutch hydrogen ecosystem and supports further cooperation and investment in sustainable energy solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
